{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t國家主席習近平下午到深圳機場，迎接出席亞太經合組織第三十三次領導人非正式會議的美國總統特朗普。<br/>\n<br/>\n習近平、特朗普和俄羅斯總統普京，明天亦會舉行歷史性的三國元首會晤。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T12:24:19.068993+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T12:00:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T21:57:59.326651+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T12:17:26.097974+00:00","content_hash":"983c45ac7ac6e36f5ca06015d5e8fe95a951263c51cd1bdf9b21d0a0927a2323","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}